CODE, CHANGING THE ZONING CLASSIFICATION FROM COUNTY A-
1 AGRICULTURAL AND RURAL RESIDENTIAL TO MR MEDIUM-
DENSITY RESIDENTIAL FOR A PORTION OF LOT 1, BLOCK 1,
CHEYENNE HILLS CHURCH SUBDIVISION AND PORTIONS OF THE
EAST HALF OF SECTION 25, T.14N., R.66W., OF THE 6TH P.M.,
